These monuments would be provided necessary tourist facilities including washrooms, drinking water, singes, cafeteria, audio visual centre, Wi-Fi, security, encroachment free area, interpretation centres, water management system.
The monuments will also be made disabled friendly.
The effort is being made to provide above facilities and amenities at these Adarsh Monuments.
Beside this the Swachch Bharath Abhiyan is also being implemented at these monuments ensuring cleanliness and healthy atmosphere within the heritage precincts.
